! name: Wikipedia reliable sources (demote only)
! description: Aligns with Wikipedia community consensus to reduce the ranking of contentious sources and eliminate unreliable sources, without elevating any source.
! public: false
! author: Wikipedia community

! Uses reliability ratings from:
!       Wikipedia:Reliable_sources/Perennial_sources
!       WikiProject_Video_games/Sources
